WEBVTT

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.590
We believe in the Tribe of Gold's
prophecy and in the fifth Nodos,

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:11.350
and we will resist the Tribe of Silver's
plot to annihilate humankind.

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:13.350
We will not compromise or give in!

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:17.600
Are you going to attack us if
we don't approve your departure?

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:20.650
As soon as we're ready, we will depart.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:33.040
I'm here for the fifth one. I am Karkinos.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.200
Age.

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:36.000
Come with me, Age.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:43.710
Dad and the others said Age needs to destroy,
one... two... three... four... four of them.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:52.680
The Tribe of Silver wants to
destroy Titarros along with us.

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:59.860
They're going to destroy this planet.

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:02.270
Your Excellency.

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:04.030
Princess?

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:07.070
Their first target is the spaceport.

00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:15.620
<b>Over and over again
I wish on the dazzling star far away</b>

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:21.880
<b>Wandering heartbeats, gravitation,
the story of their attraction</b>

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:42.020
<b>When did it begin?
No one knows the end of it</b>

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:49.400
<b>It's not a trick or an illusion,
it's a current that I can't swim against</b>

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:51.320
<b>(Dark!)</b>

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:56.330
<b>The monster that lives in the darkness</b>

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:58.040
<b>(Blight!)</b>

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:01.880
<b>As if I were easily
getting swallowed into it</b>

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.380
<b>(I seek a hero!)</b>

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:06.050
<b>I awake as I truly am</b>

00:02:06.130 --> 00:02:14.890
<b>If God says conflicts and life's
old dreams go hand in hand</b>

00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:20.390
<b>I'm looking for you even if
it means ripping my body apart</b>

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:28.820
<b>With a flower held to my heart, no one
can stop this heartbeat now that it's begun</b>

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:32.780
<b>We're destined to come in contact</b>

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:42.040
Titarros' battleships aren't following us.

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:46.210
Good. We'll accelerate as we
continue circling around Titarros.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.750
Keep the enemy behind us,
and limit our defensive range.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:51.470
We'll concentrate the firepower there.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:54.470
Launch oboronas!

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:09.740
The enemy force split into two.
One group is pursuing us,

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:13.200
and the other one seems to be
heading to Titarros' spaceport.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:17.450
We're currently accelerating
using the planet's gravity.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:21.540
Our actions have gotten
Titarros caught up in this.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:25.710
Now it's come to this, we'll lure as many
enemies after us as possible, then break away.

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:29.380
After that, we're going
to shake off the chasers.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:32.090
I'm counting on you, Captain.

00:03:32.180 --> 00:03:37.140
For Princess Dhianeila, who's
entrusted with the future of humankind,

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:39.680
surrendering here is not
even an option at this point.

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:45.770
Perhaps that made her choose the
disgrace of being branded an intruder...

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:49.610
In order to avoid turning
Titarros into a battleground.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:55.110
With the help of the Tribe of Silver,
we managed to get into space.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:58.410
We owe them for it.

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:00.120
But...

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:11.000
I can't just sit here and watch our planet get
destroyed without doing anything about it!

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:17.640
You're right. Deploy Ikaros 1 and our ships
to the area surrounding the spaceport.

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:21.390
Inform the ground troops to
prepare for air defense as well.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:23.430
What about Ikaros 2?

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:31.190
Let's have it move to the coordinates R98-S26.

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:44.160
Ikaros 1 , begin proceeding
to the space defense line.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:47.870
The security fleet is being
deployed in front of the spaceport.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.680
Oboronas in position.

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:07.730
Missiles are ready to fire.

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:09.770
Begin the attack!

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:12.690
Please begin the attack.

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:56.940
Why do you go to such lengths to fight him.

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:00.070
Age?

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:39.530
Age! What are you doing?
We're going back to the Argonaut!

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:43.030
You should go back to
where everyone is, Iolaous.

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:44.990
Age?

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:48.450
I'll catch up with you later.

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:50.500
I like the Argonaut.

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:22.110
This is strange...

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:26.530
I don't sense any intention to fight
from the man Age is confronting.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:29.910
But you said he was calling for Age...

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:33.580
Perhaps not to fight him, though.

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:36.630
Then what for...?

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:46.470
The enemy is about to enter torpedo range.

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:48.970
Withdraw the oboronas after one minute.

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:55.020
We will engage in close combat.
Deploy Organ Units and Vritarif!

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:21.880
What's our acceleration status?

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:26.090
In another ten minutes, it'll reach the
maximum value for gravity acceleration.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:28.550
Battle estimate?

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:32.600
After we leave the gravitational sphere,
the enemy will cease individual pursuit.

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:37.900
Units will rejoin their ant
heaps to resume pursuit.

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:40.770
So if we can hold out for another
10 minutes, we might be able to make it, huh...

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:44.570
47th Port, Dandelion Unit, ready to deploy.

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:47.610
Orchid Unit fully deployed.
Launchers 592 to 783, prepare to fire.

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:52.790
Narcissus Unit entering maintenance line.
 What happened to Age?

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:54.330
He'll be back later.

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:55.750
Later?

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:57.040
Yes, sir.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:58.750
I'm moving out.

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:06.090
I'll catch up with you later.

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:08.130
I like the Argonaut.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.600
Did I believe what that monkey said?

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:13.530
What are you thinking, Karkinos?

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:17.910
You could even melt the
entire planet if you wanted to!

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:31.550
This is my first time
using this power on a Nodos.

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:36.430
To you, it's like a little shock, huh?

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:38.890
Are you planning to do
something bad to the planet?

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.940
Come with me.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:51.400
Lernaea  that's the name of the Hero within me.

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:53.030
Belcross.

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:57.080
I wish I could've settled
this without transforming.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:04.210
Not on the planet, Belcross.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:48.500
Nodos...

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:35.470
Princess, we have detected multiple
gravity readings that are similar to Belcross'!

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:38.760
That's the enemy Nodos.

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:40.810
Two Nodos are fighting!

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:15.720
The Tribe of Silver has even
brought out a Nodos for this...

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:19.090
This planet is going to be destroyed!

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:22.510
What is he holding back for?

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:26.600
Because if he goes all out,
he'll end up killing the planet.

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:30.100
It's just a little warm-up to see
what the fifth one is made of.

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:34.280
Don't be ridiculous!
The fifth one is our enemy!

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:37.990
Karkinos should just wipe him out,
and the planet along with him.

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:23.780
Don't worry. It's not that bad.

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:26.790
The final defense line
has fallen back 5.8 points!

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:29.910
821 Organs capable of combat.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.000
Get the Organ Units' focus on
the defense towards the stern!

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:36.300
Everyone else respond with
close-range defensive weapons!

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:40.800
One or two thousand ants are far
from enough to destroy this Argonaut!

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:43.720
Master, it's a gravitational disturbance!

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.600
Distance: 967.

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:47.310
It's close!

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:53.350
Evade! Go under it!

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:56.770
We don't have enough time! We're going to crash!

00:14:56.860 --> 00:14:59.820
Everyone, brace for impact!

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:10.850
How fierce...

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:12.520
Check the systems!

00:16:12.600 --> 00:16:15.270
Yes, Master.

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:20.530
To think that the impact alone
could rock the Argonaut like that...

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:25.240
Nodos... Are we completely hopeless against it?

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:07.240
Belcross tore the enemy apart! He's
destroyed every single ant on our tails!

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:08.450
Master!

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:09.370
What is it?

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:12.330
Ikaros is entering the final defense line.

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:14.040
Ikaros?

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:20.540
Our only goal is to detain the Argonaut.

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:27.880
However, anyone who's attacked has
the right to self-defense. Am I wrong?

00:17:27.970 --> 00:17:30.010
You're exactly right.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:32.640
Being under the control of the
Tribe of Silver doesn't necessarily

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:36.350
mean the prosperity of our tribe.

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:41.020
Captain, Ikaros is going to
form a defensive wall for us.

00:17:41.110 --> 00:17:43.900
Now we owe them one, don't we, Princess?

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:45.610
Yes.

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:06.380
Age...

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:11.430
Do it.

00:18:21.650 --> 00:18:24.610
The Tribe of Bronze's battleships!

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:45.500
Starboard side VE block, primary armor damaged!

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:49.420
Shields are being synchronized!
Operating rate down 70%!

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:52.180
Navigation system normal.
Operating at full capacity.

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:56.220
Take evasive maneuvers!
Prepare for the second attack!

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:36.800
We're not going to make it!

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:40.020
Age!

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:39.030
That's enough.

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:42.750
I can't stand to watch it.

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:55.800
Why... Why would you go to such lengths?

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:22.080
Age! Age!

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:24.700
He's okay.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:28.500
It seems he fell asleep out of exhaustion.

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:31.210
"Iolaous is a wind."
 What?

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:39.550
Those were Age's words. He said
your voice is a gentle and powerful wind.

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:42.470
The ant heaps are leaving!

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:47.390
Controllers, remain on emergency alert.
Write up all the damage on the ship.

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:49.440
I want to know the
condition of Titarros, as well.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:51.150
Yes, Master.

00:21:54.030 --> 00:21:58.150
The enemy Nodos didn't
intend to defeat Belcross.

00:21:58.240 --> 00:22:01.030
Was it just testing it?

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:06.410
But still, the battle of the Nodos
was beyond our imagination...

00:22:14.090 --> 00:22:17.970
Why did you initiate the fight with the Nodos?

00:22:18.050 --> 00:22:25.010
Did your mission from the
Tribe of Gold extend that far?

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:34.270
Although I have known you for a long time

00:22:34.360 --> 00:22:41.610
l never dreamed these feelings would sprout

00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:46.740
And I would fall in love with you

00:22:46.830 --> 00:22:57.670
Casually going home,
as I look at the stars in the night sky

00:22:57.760 --> 00:23:10.640
l take the long way on purpose
and lean on your shoulder as we walk

00:23:10.730 --> 00:23:21.570
You tell me you think we can overcome
anything as long as we stay together

00:23:21.660 --> 00:23:26.870
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:23:26.950 --> 00:23:33.580
That I love you

00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:42.050
ln order to take Age back to his mother planet,
the Argonaut leaves the starway once again.

00:23:42.130 --> 00:23:45.510
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 6: "The Cemetery Belt."
